# Listing Files
>In this challenge, we've named /challenge/run with some random name! List the files in /challenge to find it. Then invoke the discovered absolute path to get the flag.
## Solve:
- Implemented ls straight away.
```
bash
hacker@commands~listing-files:~$ cd /challenge
hacker@commands~listing-files:/challenge$ ls
11376-renamed-run-27550  Dockerfile
hacker@commands~listing-files:/challenge$ ./11376-renamed-run-27550
Yahaha, you found me! Here is your flag:
pwn.college{IulnDa0BeucPn5klxbFryO4w9ZG.QX4IDO0wiM4ETOwIzW}
```
##Flag
```
put{IulnDa0BeucPn5klxbFryO4w9ZG.QX4IDO0wiM4ETOwIzW}
```

